usage: app.py [-h] [--project PROJECT] [--file FILE] [--theme {light,dark}]
              [--runtime RUNTIME] [--session-info SESSION_INFO] [--user USER]
              [--role {developer,monitor}]

OpenBEXI standalone Python desktop IDE

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --project PROJECT     Project folder to open
  --file FILE           File inside the project to edit
  --theme {light,dark}  Light or dark theme
  --runtime RUNTIME     Select an installed runtime backend, for example spell
  --session-info SESSION_INFO
                        Private session invitation JSON
  --user USER           Shared-session display name
  --role {developer,monitor}
